 Because `frai-core` is a regular ESM package, you can import only the modules you need and embed FRAI capabilities inside automation pipelines, CI jobs, or custom products.
 
+Example: use thresholds to gate evaluation reports.
+
+```ts
+import { Eval } from 'frai-core';
+
+const evaluations = Eval.runEvaluations({ outputs, references });
+const report = Eval.generateReport({
+  evaluations,
+  outputsPath: '/tmp/outputs.json',
+  referencesPath: '/tmp/refs.json',
+  thresholds: { exact_match: 0.9, length_variance: 0.95 }
+});
+
+if (!report.passed) {
+  console.error('Evaluation failed: some thresholds not met');
+  process.exit(1);
+}
+
+Eval.writeReport({ report, format: 'markdown', reportPath: 'eval-report.md' });
+```
